s-4 MuiGrid-grid-md-6 mui-1emhy7b"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-x1fpip" data-digital-articles-heading="true"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-0" data-digital-articles-date="true"><h6 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-subtitle1 mui-1i637ec">14 Jul 2023</h6></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-tc44qp" data-digital-articles-title="true"><h1 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-p61zj3">Marex North America accounts to transfer to Marex Capital Markets Inc.</h1></div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-4 MuiGrid-grid-md-6 MuiGrid-grid-lg-5 mui-11sxiqy"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1t88g69" data-digital-articles-body="true"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1yp4bow"><p>As of Friday July 14, 2023, all accounts carried by Marex North America (“MNA”) transferred to Marex Capital Markets Inc. (“MCM”), an affiliate under common control with MNA.</p>
<p>The aim of this move is to consolidate all of Marex’s US futures activity into a single entity – MCM. MCM is a registered broker-dealer as well as a futures commission merchant, which means clients will have greater access to a broader choice of product offerings.</p>
